The pole has no length, so the 18 seconds is just the time for the train’s own 300 m to pass. The platform is 350 m long, and at the train’s speed that takes 35 seconds. So the total time to cross the platform is the time for the train itself plus the time for the platform:  
18 + 35 = 53 seconds.  

